  "notes": [
    "All unchanged_copies preserve original bytes, including absolute paths, random witness identifiers, timing, statuses, and original scope limitations.",
    "Paths in raw observations identify original execution locations; they are not rewritten portable replay paths and are not promised to exist after this session.",
    "artifacts.json is the unchanged 152-entry full experiment-14 run inventory, not an inventory of the files included in this selected directory.",
    "original-retention.json describes the earlier 140-file coordination selection, not this smaller repository selection.",
    "No upstream source or header snapshots, compiled products, full link maps, or full nm listings are included. Source URLs and byte identities remain in source-manifest.json.",
    "Excerpts concatenate complete original lines without modification. The explicit source ranges and full-source hashes below identify precisely what was omitted.",
    "The per-command records directory and remaining logs/plan are omitted; commands.json and results.json retain original command/result observations.",
    "Experiment-08 and experiment-18 selections are limited to the listed raw JSON; their other source snapshots, probe scripts, logs, maps, objects and executables are not included.",
    "Hashes provide content integrity, not proof of execution or durable availability of omitted artifacts.",
    "This manifest excludes itself from included_file_count and included_bytes to avoid a recursive self-hash.",
    "Checkpoint-01 and checkpoint-02 excerpts retain exact first/last log lines; their full test logs are not included. Commit/tree association is documented by the integrating agent in the evidence page."
  ],
